<%#
  SMP-1852 — CZID-330 export-control deny UX. Shown to a user whose latest attestation decision is
  "declined". Non-bypassable by design: there is NO "continue anyway" link — the only affordances are to
  re-attest (return to the attestation page and accept) or to sign out. Rendered with HTTP 403.

  Shape + styling come from the shared export_control/_deny shell.
%>
<%= render layout: "export_control/deny",
           locals: { heading: "Access denied",
                     retry_path: new_export_control_attestation_path,
                     retry_label: "Review the acknowledgement again" } do %>
  <p>
    Access to this service requires the export-control acknowledgement. Because that acknowledgement was
    not provided, access cannot be granted.
  </p>
<% end %>
